[en.FOCUS_C12_TREASURE_EVERYWHERE]
Treasure Everywhere

[en.FOCUS_C12_TREASURE_EVERYWHERE_desc]
Even though the rock farm sits on barren land, beneath the surface lies abundant mineral resources. We should immediately prepare to extract them. This will provide a powerful boost to our lagging economy.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_TREASURE_EVERYWHERE]
矿石遍地

[zh.FOCUS_C12_TREASURE_EVERYWHERE_desc]
采石农场虽然有着贫瘠的土地，但地表之下是丰富的矿产资源，我们应该立即准备开采他们，这将给我们落后的经济一股强大的动力

